<title>RUSSIA: Russia's St Petersburg says delays road-show.</title>
<headline>Russia's St Petersburg says delays road-show.</headline>
<dateline>YEKATERINBURG, Russia 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Petersburg, Russia's second biggest city, will delay the start of a road show for its debut Eurobond by two to three weeks, a senior deputy on the city's local parliament said on Thursday.</p>
<p>City officials had previously said the road-show will start after May 20.  </p>
<p>Later lead-manager Salomon Bros said the road-show would start as planned on Friday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
